    title: "bash analyzer: re-exported VAR produces multiple Symbol nodes for same (path,name,kind); 50% dup rate on export-kind drives SCRIPTS DEFAULT INV-bazij breach at 7.0%"  # 9551
    status: todo_hard  # 9551
    priority: 2  # 9551
